    "answer": {
      "short": "$y = [-2, 0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 32]$; equation: $y=2x-2$",
      "worked": "Substitute each value of $x$ into the equation $y = 2x - 2$:\n- For $x = 0$: $y = 2(0) - 2 = -2$\n- For $x = 1$: $y = 2(1) - 2 = 0$\n- For $x = 2$: $y = 2(2) - 2 = 2$\n- For $x = 3$: $y = 2(3) - 2 = 4$\n- For $x = 4$: $y = 2(4) - 2 = 6$\n- For $x = 5$: $y = 2(5) - 2 = 8$\n- For $x = 17$: $y = 2(17) - 2 = 32$\n\nPlot the visible points $(1, 0), (2, 2), (3, 4), (4, 6), (5, 8), (6, 10)$ on the Cartesian plane and join with a straight line.",
      "solutionDiagrams": [
        {
          "id": "page-60-q4-solution-diagram",
